//! task: write
//! ask: Write a function mapping a u8 mode number to a score with `discerne`: 1 gives 10, 2 gives 20, anything else 0.
//! expect: ok
//! refs: §8.5
//! explain: `discerne` selects over a scrutinee with `casus` arms. A scalar scrutinee's value space is 2^N, so exhaustiveness can only be had with an `aliter` arm; without one it is EXS-E0351. Arms are blocks, there is no fallthrough, and the first matching arm wins.

publica functio puncta(modus: u8) -> u8 {
    discerne modus {
        casus 1 { redde 10; }
        casus 2 { redde 20; }
        aliter  { redde 0; }
    }
}
